  "details": "Deleting VRChat avatars due to account suspension is unfair. Avatars represent users' digital identities and creative expression. Removing them punishes users that don't have access to a pc to upload them and also finding the creators who the user has commissioned to reupload them onto their account.   \n\nIt would be understandable if the ban was related to misusage of avatars (Crashers,Etc)\n\nBut a false report (spam reports) should not lead to getting avatars be deleted.",
